DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Golda Meir\, whose 16th Yahrze
 it occurs on Monday\, February 15\, corresponding to the 8th of Adar I\, 5
 787.\n\nGolda Meir’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Sunday\, February 14 
 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to l
 ight a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved o
 ne’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory s
 erve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
